<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>T-MIM | Software para Talleres Mecánicos y de Motos</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <%= csrf_meta_tags %>
  <%= csp_meta_tag %>
  <%= favicon_link_tag 'favicon.ico' %>

  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">

  <style>
    :root {
      --tmim-navy: #041C36;
      --tmim-blue: #0d6efd;
      --tmim-cyan: #00b4d8;
      --tmim-orange: #f77f00;
      --tmim-dark: #021224;
      --tmim-gray: #f8fafc;
    }
    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }
    body {
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #334155;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }
    .navbar-tmim {
      background: rgba(4, 28, 54, 0.96);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }
    .hero-section {
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top right, #0a3560, #041C36 75%);
      color: white;
      padding: 6.5rem 0 4.5rem 0;
      position: relative;
    }
    .badge-tmim-cyan {
      background-color: rgba(0, 180, 216, 0.15);
      color: #48cae4;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 180, 216, 0.35);
      padding: 0.45rem 1.1rem;
      border-radius: 50px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      display: inline-block;
    }
    .plan-accordion-item {
      border: 2px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 16px !important;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: all 0.25s ease;
      background: #ffffff;
    }
    .plan-accordion-item:hover {
      border-color: var(--tmim-cyan);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
    }
    .plan-accordion-item.featured {
      border-color: var(--tmim-cyan);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 180, 216, 0.15);
    }
    .plan-accordion-button {
      padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
      background: white !important;
      color: var(--tmim-navy) !important;
      box-shadow: none !important;
    }
    .plan-accordion-button:not(.collapsed) {
      background: #f0f9ff !important;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e0f2fe;
    }
    .btn-tmim-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00b4d8, #0d6efd);
      color: white;
      border: none;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 0.75rem 1.8rem;
      border-radius: 50px;
      transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-block;
    }
    .btn-tmim-primary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(13, 110, 253, 0.3);
      color: white;
    }
    .btn-tmim-orange {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f77f00, #d62828);
      color: white;
      border: none;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
      border-radius: 50px;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-block;
    }
    .btn-tmim-orange:hover {
      opacity: 0.95;
      color: white;
    }
    .btn-tmim-outline {
      border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
      color: white;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 0.7rem 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 50px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-tmim-outline:hover {
      background: white;
      color: var(--tmim-navy);
    }
    .feature-card {
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 2rem;
      background: white;
      transition: transform 0.2s;
      height: 100%;
    }
    .feature-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      border-color: var(--tmim-cyan);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <!-- Navbar -->
  <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark navbar-tmim fixed-top py-3">
    <div class="container">
      <a class="navbar-brand d-flex align-items-center gap-2 fw-bold fs-4 text-white" href="/">
        <i class="fas fa-tools text-info"></i> T-MIM
        <span class="badge bg-primary fs-6 fw-normal ms-1">Talleres</span>
      </a>
      <button class="navbar-toggler border-0" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navTmim">
        <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navTmim">
        <ul class="navbar-nav mx-auto mb-2 mb-lg-0 fw-semibold">
          <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link text-white-50" href="#que-es">¿Qué es T-MIM?</a></li>
          <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link text-white-50" href="#soluciones">Beneficios</a></li>
          <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link text-info fw-bold" href="#planes">Planes & Precios</a></li>
          <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link text-white-50" href="#contratar">Contacto</a></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="d-flex gap-2">
          <%= link_to new_user_session_path, class: "btn btn-outline-light rounded-pill px-3 py-2 fw-semibold" do %>
            <i class="fas fa-sign-in-alt me-1"></i> Iniciar Sesión
          <% end %>
          <a href="#planes" class="btn btn-tmim-primary rounded-pill px-3 py-2 fw-bold">
            <i class="fas fa-bolt me-1"></i> Ver Planes
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- Flash Messages -->
  <div class="position-fixed top-0 end-0 p-3" style="z-index: 1080; margin-top: 80px;">
    <% if flash[:notice].present? %>
      <div class="alert alert-success alert-dismissible fade show shadow-lg border-0" role="alert">
        <i class="fas fa-check-circle me-2"></i> <%= flash[:notice] %>
        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="alert"></button>
      </div>
    <% end %>
    <% if flash[:alert].present? %>
      <div class="alert alert-danger alert-dismissible fade show shadow-lg border-0" role="alert">
        <i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle me-2"></i> <%= flash[:alert] %>
        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="alert"></button>
      </div>
    <% end %>
  </div>

  <%= yield %>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer class="py-5 text-white" style="background-color: var(--tmim-dark); border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
    <div class="container text-center text-md-start">
      <div class="row g-4 mb-4">
        <div class="col-md-5">
          <h4 class="fw-bold mb-2 text-white"><i class="fas fa-tools text-info me-2"></i>T-MIM</h4>
          <p class="text-white-50 small pe-md-4">
            Plataforma especializada en la gestión operativa de talleres mecánicos, servicios de motos y centros automotrices. Respaldado y provisto por <strong>Mounkey SpA</strong>, Puerto Montt, Chile.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-3">
          <h6 class="text-uppercase fw-bold text-info mb-3 small">Navegación</h6>
          <ul class="list-unstyled small text-white-50 mb-0">
            <li class="mb-2"><a href="#que-es" class="text-white-50 text-decoration-none">¿Qué es T-MIM?</a></li>
            <li class="mb-2"><a href="#planes" class="text-white-50 text-decoration-none">Planes y Precios</a></li>
            <li class="mb-2"><a href="#contratar" class="text-white-50 text-decoration-none">Solicitud de Alta</a></li>
            <li><%= link_to "Acceso Usuarios", new_user_session_path, class: "text-white-50 text-decoration-none" %></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <h6 class="text-uppercase fw-bold text-info mb-3 small">Contacto Comercial</h6>
          <p class="text-white-50 small mb-1"><i class="fas fa-envelope text-info me-2"></i> contacto@tmim.cl</p>
          <p class="text-white-50 small mb-1"><i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt text-info me-2"></i> Puerto Montt, Región de Los Lagos, Chile</p>
          <p class="text-white-50 small"><i class="fas fa-credit-card text-info me-2"></i> Pagos automáticos seguros procesados vía Flow</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="border-top border-secondary pt-3 d-flex flex-column flex-md-row justify-content-between align-items-center text-white-50 small">
        <div>&copy; <%= Date.today.year %> T-MIM &bull; Todos los derechos reservados. Desarrollado por Mounkey SpA.</div>
        <div class="mt-2 mt-md-0">
          <span>Ley 19.799 Firma Electrónica &bull; Jurisdicción Tribunales Ordinarios de Puerto Montt</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
